<node id="paper::broad_12549367c327c283ccf7::claim_pt_tunes_surface_states_and_hydrogen_kinetics">
  <data key="d4">MechanismClaim</data>
  <data key="d5">Single-atom platinum in Pt/np-Co0.85Se optimizes the surface states of Co0.85Se active centers under realistic working conditions, reduces the energy barriers of water dissociation, and improves hydrogen adsorption/desorption behavior, thereby synergistically promoting hydrogen-evolution thermodynamics and kinetics.</data>
  <data key="d18">electronic_and_kinetic_mechanism</data>
  <data key="d19">Single-atom platinum in Pt/np-Co0.85Se optimizes the surface states of Co0.85Se active centers under realistic working conditions, reduces the energy barriers of water dissociation, and improves hydrogen adsorption/desorption behavior, thereby synergistically promoting hydrogen-evolution thermodynamics and kinetics.</data>
  <data key="d20">mixed</data>
  <data key="d6">The abstract attributes this interpretation to operando X-ray absorption spectroscopy combined with density functional theory calculations.</data>
  <data key="d7">["claim_pt_tunes_surface_states_and_hydrogen_kinetics"]</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">broad_mechanism_abstract</data>
  <data key="d10">broad_abstract_support</data>
  <data key="d11">True</data>
  <data key="d12">abstract</data>
  <data key="d13">type: MechanismClaim
label: Single-atom platinum in Pt/np-Co0.85Se optimizes the surface states of Co0.85Se active centers under realistic working conditions, reduces the energy barriers of water dissociation, and improves hydrogen adsorption/desorption behavior, thereby synergistically promoting hydrogen-evolution thermodynamics and kinetics.
source depth: abstract
epistemic use: exploration/bridge; verify before target-domain premise use
description: The abstract attributes this interpretation to operando X-ray absorption spectroscopy combined with density functional theory calculations.</data>
  <data key="d14">broad_12549367c327c283ccf7</data>
  <data key="d15">claim_pt_tunes_surface_states_and_hydrogen_kinetics</data>
  <data key="d16">["broad_12549367c327c283ccf7"]</data>
